Third-party and competition-provided material in this repository
================================================================

The MIT license in LICENSE covers the work of Team Issyk Cool only. It does
NOT cover the following, which are redistributed here for reproducibility and
remain the property of their respective owners:

1. `_ogc/official_checker.py`
   Byte-identical to `utils.py` from the official OGC 2026 competition
   package, distributed by the Optimization Grand Challenge 2026 Organizing
   Committee. It is the organizers' feasibility checker and scorer. It is
   included unmodified because the solver calls it as an independent
   verification oracle before emitting a solution, and because any
   reproduction of the reported scores has to use the same scorer. No
   authorship of this file is claimed.

2. `data/finals/*.json` and `data/preliminary/*.json`
   The competition's evaluation instances, published by the Organizing
   Committee after the respective rounds closed. Redistributed unmodified so
   that the results reported in docs/RESULTS.md can be reproduced. No
   authorship or ownership of this data is claimed.

3. `docs/problem_statement.md`
   A restatement of the official problem specification, written by the team
   from the Organizing Committee's problem statement PDF. The underlying
   problem definition is the organizers'.

Competition: Optimization Grand Challenge 2026 — "The Grand Shipyard Puzzle:
